{"message":"SUCCESS","data":{"tab_index":0,"tab_item":[{"tab_type":8,"client_tab_type":0,"title":"找剧","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":401,"cell_name":"","cell_operation_type":1,"use_recommend":true,"cell_abstract":"","cell_id_str":"6952850996422770718","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":402,"cell_name":"小卡","cell_operation_type":0,"use_recommend":false,"video_data":[{"vid":"7508689958824070206","cover":"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/2955bd5c30324e6a6eafa6347a17d59b~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:400:0.image?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1799164617&x-signature=qjvr1nPR7n9ztuaj9IADc0sojTg%3D","duration":8188,"title":"独占姝色","video_desc":"沈纭曾是花楼妓子，赎身从良后，嫁与书生萧泊谦为妻，安稳度日。一日，萧泊谦因酒后妄议朝政被抓入狱，为救夫君免受牢狱之苦，走投无路的沈纭，只得向大理寺少卿自荐枕席。令她万万没想到的是，这位大理寺少卿，正是她为妓时所接的唯一一位恩客陆庭洲。陆庭洲身为京城第一世家嫡三子，初见沈纭时便将她视作自己的所有物，也正因如此，他一直恼怒沈纭当年用自己的玉佩擅自赎身、离他而去。","series_id":"7508633887036148798","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106235656280E3DF9524B0A95BB28\",\"rank\":\"1\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7508633887036148798\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.07193169742822647,\\\"like\\\":0.052618950605392456,\\\"collect\\\":0.03676946833729744,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.1630131006240845,\\\"finish\\\":0.001810210756957531,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.11219688504934311,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7174649238586426}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7508633887036148798","play_cnt":38619,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"树下的椰子","sub_title":"爱情·古风爱情","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":61,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5000,\"name\":\"爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5000&categoryName=爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5051,\"name\":\"古风爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?c